<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>PM Tool Requirements Document</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>PM Tool Requirements Document</h1>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Attribute</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Team Size</td><td>&lt;!-- e.g., 30 users --&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>Growth Expected</td><td>&lt;!-- e.g., 50 users in 2 years --&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>Budget Ceiling</td><td>&lt;!-- e.g., $20/user/month max --&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>Decision Timeline</td><td>&lt;!-- e.g., Q1 implementation --&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>Compliance Requirements</td><td>&lt;!-- e.g., SOC2 Type II, GDPR --&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>Deployment Model</td><td>&lt;!-- cloud / self-hosted / both --&gt;</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Stakeholder Interview Questions</h2>
<h3>Current State</h3>
<ul><li>What tools do you currently use for project management?</li><li>What works well with your current setup?</li><li>What are your biggest pain points?</li></ul>
<h3>Workflow Needs</h3>
<ul><li>Describe your typical project lifecycle.</li><li>What approval processes do you have?</li><li>What integrations are essential (GitHub, Slack, CI/CD)?</li></ul>
<h3>Team Context</h3>
<ul><li>How many people will use the tool?</li><li>What are their technical skill levels?</li><li>Do you have remote or distributed teams?</li></ul>
<h3>Future Needs</h3>
<ul><li>How do you expect team size to grow in the next 2 years?</li><li>Are there compliance requirements coming?</li></ul>
<h2>Requirements (MoSCoW)</h2>
<h3>Must Have</h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Evidence Quote</th><th>Speaker</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>R01</td><td>&lt;!-- e.g., Sprint planning with burndown --&gt;</td><td>&lt;!-- verbatim quote --&gt;</td><td>&lt;!-- name --&gt;</td></tr><tr><td>R02</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3>Should Have</h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Evidence Quote</th><th>Speaker</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>R07</td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3>Could Have</h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>R13</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3>Won't Have (this selection)</h3>
<table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Requirement</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>W01</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>Hard Constraints (applied before feature evaluation)</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Constraint</th><th>Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Price ceiling</td><td>$__ /user/month</td></tr><tr><td>Data residency</td><td>US / EU / other</td></tr><tr><td>Compliance</td><td>SOC2 / ISO27001 / HIPAA / FedRAMP</td></tr><tr><td>SSO/IDP</td><td>SAML 2.0 / OIDC + SCIM</td></tr><tr><td>Deployment</td><td>Cloud only / Self-hosted required</td></tr><tr><td>Data export</td><td>Full export required before shortlist</td></tr></tbody></table>
</body></html>
